%% v38 · 7 Jul 2026 · 🍚 LEFTOVERS FEATURE EXPANDED + RESEARCHED (Tina: NOT meat-only — she made leftover rice+egg+mayo; wants CREATIVE/UNUSUAL, not sad meat sandwiches; asked for proper research). → new file TINZA_LEFTOVERS_RESEARCH.md. KEY SHIFTS for the build: (1) RE-KEY LEFTOVER_IDEAS from meat-GROUP → BASE LEFTOVER (rice/bread/pasta/potato/pap/roast-veg/chicken/beef/lamb/pork/seafood/beans/cheese/fruit/egg), 3-5 unusual-first ideas each + per-dish overrides. (2) CREATIVE ENGINE = base leftover × TECHNIQUE (crisp · bind&cake · bowl · bake/gratin · soup/stock · refresh w/ aromatics+acid · sweeten) → generates ideas, not a fixed list. (3) HERITAGE HOOK — lead with 'the world's best dishes were born from leftovers' (nasi goreng · pain perdu · bubble&squeak · chilaquiles · ribollita · feijoada · tetrazzini) = aspirational, not frugal. (4) 🚨 FOOD SAFETY = NON-NEGOTIABLE, MUST be built in: rice/pasta/potato carry Bacillus cereus; the vomiting toxin is HEAT-STABLE → reheating does NOT fix it, STORAGE does. Rules: 2-HR rule (1 hr for rice / hot SA days) · cool FAST (spread thin, never leave in the pot/cooker) · fridge ≤5°C · most leftovers 3-4 days, RICE 1 day (FSA) · reheat ONCE to ~74°C steaming-hot · freeze for longer. AUTO-ATTACH a 'keep it safe' note to every leftover idea; HARD rule for rice/pasta/potato. REUSE the Storage rules engine (leftovers + storage = same safety data, two views). SA-first (pap→next-morning porridge / fried pap slices · braai-meat lasagne-potjie [Jan Braai freeze-tub] · braai-meat stroganoff folded through pap). Pro feature; ties to Pantry / Anchor Ingredient / 4-Ingredients / Profile 'leftover suggestions' toggle. BUILD alongside the app-wide nutrition roll (shares the storage-rules engine). ⬇ v37
